    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Car Wash Quality Control Workflow (Summary)\nThis workflow automatically:\n\nMonitors a Google Drive folder for new car wash photos\n\nUses GPT-4 Vision to analyze the images\n\nScores the quality and detects issues\n\nRoutes failed inspections for follow-up\n\nSends notifications and logs results\n\nSetup Instructions\nSet your Google Drive folder ID in the trigger node\n\nAdd credentials for Google Drive, Gmail, Slack, OpenAI, and Sheets\n\nUpdate Slack channels and email addresses as needed\n\nCreate a Google Sheet with these columns:\n\nInspection ID\n\nTimestamp\n\nContractor ID\n\nFile Name\n\nQuality Score\n\nAssessment\n\nIssues Count\n\nIssue Types\n\nSeverities\n\nFeedback Sent",
        "height": 770,
